ts (e.g. `npm init`)\n1131: \n1132: ## 0.3.10\n1133: \n1134: ### Fixed\n1135: \n1136: - Live bash command reveal only when waiting for input\n1137: \n1138: ## 0.3.9\n1139: \n1140: ### Added\n1141: \n1142: - Re-pick model when provider token changes at startup\n1143: - Custom model id entry in picker\n1144: - Surface actionable turn errors (revoked key, quota exceeded, no access)\n1145: - Recover from dead provider connection at startup\n1146: - Esc stops the running turn; Ctrl+C exits with confirmation\n1147: \n1148: ### Fixed\n1149: \n1150: - Provider key persistence on re-entry\n1151: - Distinguish aborted, disconnected, and completed turns at stream end\n1152: \n1153: ## 0.3.8\n1154: \n1155: ### Changed\n1156: \n1157: - Streaming and rendering logic overhaul for chat messages\n1158: \n1159: ## 0.3.7\n1160: \n1161: ### Added\n1162: \n1163: - StdinManager for handling interactive input in child processes\n1164: \n1165: ### Changed\n1166: \n1167: - Streamlined session handling\n1168: \n1169: ## 0.3.6\n1170: \n1171: ### Fixed\n1172: \n1173: - Inline model context windows map (removed external JSON file dependency)\n1174: \n1175: ## 0.3.5\n1176: \n1177: ### Changed\n1178: \n1179: - Documentation updates\n1180: \n1181: ## 0.3.4\n1182: \n1183: ### Fixed\n1184: \n1185: - Message sanitization and tool call handling\n1186: \n1187: ## 0.3.3\n1188: \n1189: ### Fixed\n1190: \n1191: - `/steer` behavior when idle (now submits as normal prompt)\n1192: \n1193: ## 0.3.2\n1194: \n1195: ### Added\n1196: \n1197: - Paste chip functionality in Composer\n1198: - Command aliases: `/s` for `/steer`, `/q` for `/queue`\n1199: - Nested context file resolution (AGENTS.md in subdirectories)\n1200: \n1201: ## 0.3.0\n1202: \n1203: ### Added\n1204: \n1205: - **Rules system** — Cursor-compatible `.cast/rules/*.md` with always/auto/lazy/manual modes\n1206: - `@rule-name` mentions in messages\n1207: - Chat log display improvements (clampTailToRows)\n1208: \n1209: ## 0.2.3\n1210: \n1211: ### Added\n1