t: recover from a dead provider connection at startup\n7312443 feat: custom model id entry + clearer picker feedback\nc98c6d0 fix: drain settled stream blocks into <Static> so tall turns don't stack\n6053601 feat: surface actionable turn errors (revoked key, quota, no access)\n991b40e chore: bump version to 0.3.8\n2a29a32 refactor: enhance streaming and rendering logic for chat messages\n175ac95 chore: bump version to 0.3.7\n5434f03 refactor: streamline session handling by clearing context directly\n998575f feat: implement StdinManager for handling interactive input in child processes\n4dfe0e1 chore: bump version to 0.3.6\ne32e73e fix: inline model context windows map instead of reading JSON file\n581dbb8 chore: bump version to 0.3.5\n255bdd4 docs: update AGENTS.md for clarity and structure\n0282341 chore: bump version to 0.3.4\n04549a4 fix: enhance message sanitization and tool call handling\nbe30991 chore: bump version to 0.3.3\n323d04b fix: update /steer command behavior when idle\n66513d6 refactor: update paste handling logic in Composer and related utilities\n69ee1b8 chore: bump version to 0.3.2\nb382b49 feat: implement paste chip functionality in Composer\n7f707a4 feat: add command aliases for /steer and /queue\n2c503b2 chore: bump version to0.3.1\n53d2808 feat: implement resolveNestedContextFiles function for dynamic context file resolution\na338d07 fix(ci): drop Node 18 from test matrix (EOL April 2025)\n0fbf383 chore: bump version to 0.3.0\n5037f0b feat: implement clampTailToRows function for managing chat log display\n7c36106 feat: introduce project-specific rules and enhance frontmatter parsing\n8527404 chore: bump version to 0.2.3\nf8cd3bc feat: add system state block to system prompt and improve unknown reasoning handling\ne93dffa fix(cast): correct resource priority levels in SKILL.md docs\n7e82faa chore: bump version to 0.2.1\n2c543e5 feat: add /keys command listing all keybindings\nc751ca1 chore: remove REBRAND.md and RESSTRUCTURE.md files as part of