ng\n1044: - 8 new dangerous bash patterns (fork bombs, `shutdown`, `npm publish`, `killall`, etc.)\n1045: \n1046: ## 0.4.6\n1047: \n1048: ### Changed\n1049: \n1050: - Enhanced dangerous command detection in permissions\n1051: \n1052: ## 0.4.5\n1053: \n1054: ### Changed\n1055: \n1056: - Removed interactive command checks from permissions (simplified)\n1057: \n1058: ## 0.4.4\n1059: \n1060: ### Added\n1061: \n1062: - **Web tools** — `web_search` (DuckDuckGo) and `web_fetch` (Jina Reader) for internet access\n1063: - Web tools are off by default; toggle with `/web` (persists to settings)\n1064: \n1065: ## 0.4.3\n1066: \n1067: ### Added\n1068: \n1069: - **Doom loop detection** — blocks a tool after 3 identical consecutive calls with the same arguments\n1070: \n1071: ### Fixed\n1072: \n1073: - Streaming viewport clamping and scroll position issues\n1074: \n1075: ## 0.4.2\n1076: \n1077: ### Added\n1078: \n1079: - `/copy` command — copy last assistant response to clipboard\n1080: \n1081: ### Fixed\n1082: \n1083: - Scroll position not resetting on resync while user is scrolled up\n1084: \n1085: ## 0.4.1\n1086: \n1087: ### Fixed\n1088: \n1089: - Atomic writes for session and settings files (prevents corruption on crash)\n1090: - Session listing and MCP connect timeout hardening\n1091: - Clear error on missing required prompt files\n1092: - Persona sorting uses label instead of name\n1093: \n1094: ### Changed\n1095: \n1096: - Split `tools.ts` into per-tool modules (`bash.ts`, `files.ts`, `search.ts`, `web.ts`, `task.ts`)\n1097: - Centralized prompts directory resolution\n1098: \n1099: ## 0.4.0\n1100: \n1101: ### Added\n1102: \n1103: - Multi-source personas — project-local, global, and builtin with priority ordering\n1104: - Sub-agent support via the `task` tool — delegate work to isolated sub-agents\n1105: - `coder-with-subagents` persona\n1106: \n1107: ## 0.3.17\n1108: \n1109: ### Added\n1110: \n1111: - Brace expansion in glob patterns\n1112: - Enhanced gitignore handling\n11